Subject: [PATCH] chore(builder): tiers3 isotropic simplification option

---
 geocoder/builder/src/cell_index.cpp |  3 +++
 geocoder/builder/src/geometry.h     | 36 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 2 files changed, 39 insertions(+)

